  "notes": "Literature baseline: a reproduction of a code published with arXiv:2609.30069, rebuilt from the authors' data repository (https://github.com/ultra-high-rate-qec/design-principles-data/blob/306b31d/codes/reverse_fold/j4l10/instances/reverse_j4l10_p18.json). Not a new construction. The authors report d = 11 as exact. Their lower-bound search output is not in the repository, so this entry carries an upper bound backed by their weight-11 Pauli logical, stored as the witness."
